      "text": "会话内工作记忆 (In-Session Working Memory)\n(working_memory.py · <=2400 字符硬预算)\ngoal / constraints(<=8) / todos(<=10) / facts(<=12)\n随单次 Run 生灭 · 置于第 3 缓存断点后尾部注入",
