      "text": "实时源码哈希校验与自动判 Stale\n(audit_working_memory · bound_files SHA-256)\n强制绑定真实文件或成功 tool_call (result_sha256)\n底层代码变更即降级 stale · 绝不写入跨会话存储",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "wm_sha_guard",
      "originalText": "实时源码哈希校验与自动判 Stale\n(audit_working_memory · bound_files SHA-256)\n强制绑定真实文件或成功 tool_call (result_sha256)\n底层代码变更即降级 stale · 绝不写入跨会话存储",
      "autoResize": true,
