      "text": "三层认知粒度层次 (Layer 0 / Layer 1 / Layer 2)\nL0: 双层 MEMORY.md 常驻导航 (<=200行 / <=4000字)\nL1: rules/ traps/ wiki/ journal/ (<=12KiB · 64页/层)\nL2: SQLite runs 历史 Transcripts + memories KV 表",
