      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "锁外写入离线整理审计表 (dream_runs 表)\n(释放 flock 后调 storage.record_dream_run)\n按 (tenant_id, project_slug, created_at) 独立索引\n记录纠错/合成/修链/行数统计，闭环反哺下次会话 Step 0",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "dream_runs_audit",
      "originalText": "锁外写入离线整理审计表 (dream_runs 表)\n(释放 flock 后调 storage.record_dream_run)\n按 (tenant_id, project_slug, created_at) 独立索引\n记录纠错/合成/修链/行数统计，闭环反哺下次会话 Step 0",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "footer_note_06",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60.0,
      "y": 1522.0,
      "width": 1562.0,
      "height": 17.0,
